@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Public application metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/info
Accept: application/json

### Process liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### PostgreSQL and RabbitMQ readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### API contract (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Unknown endpoint returns Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown
Accept: application/problem+json
